我又死回来了
And I am storming back in.

343
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:10,340
天黑了  学校不开门
It is dark outside. That school's not open.

344
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,320
喂  就是你
Hey, you.

345
00:16:17,400 --> 00:16:18,900
水果塔混球  我有话跟你说
Tart tease, we need a word.

346
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:24,160
你说你喜欢我的水果塔  然后抱歉地通知我
You love my pastries and then regret to inform me

347
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:25,360
我不够格念你的学校
I'm not good enough for your school?

348
00:16:25,500 --> 00:16:28,780
我抱歉地通知你  我绝对够格
Well, I regret to inform you that I am good enough

349
00:16:28,780 --> 00:16:30,060
我想知道你不录取我的原因
and I want to know why you won't let me in here.

350
00:16:32,220 --> 00:16:34,440
你的声音会触发我的焦虑症
Okay, uh, your voice is an anxiety trigger for me.

351
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:37,260
现在这状况不适合我  我要离开这里
I'm going to have to remove myself from the situation

352
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:38,400
去走廊坐着
and go sit in the hallway.

353
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:43,220
你能陪我去吗  你的存在能安抚人心
Can you come with me? You have a very calming presence.

354
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:47,040
谢谢  很少有人会这么觉得
Thank you. So few people think that about me.

355
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:48,420
但我应该陪着麦克斯
But I should stay with Max.

356
00:16:48,560 --> 00:16:50,160
去吧  我能处理好  你可以带她走
No, I got this handled. You can have her.

357
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,380
这是你最后一次把我扔给别人
This is the last time you give me to someone.

358
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:57,040
麦克斯  你的水果塔做得很棒
Max, your tart was excellent.

359
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:58,920
但问题在于你的态度
The problem was your attitude.

360
00:16:59,560 --> 00:17:02,160
你对这个学校没表现出半点热忱
You showed no passion of wanting to be in this school.

361
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:04,920
这就是你没被录取的原因
And that is why you didn't get in.

362
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:07,460
因为你看上去并不想来这
It seemed like you didn't want it.

363
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:09,980
不  我对什么事都是这态度
No, no, no, that's just my attitude.

364
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:12,000
我表现得我不喜欢任何事物
I act like I don't want anything

365
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,780
是因为我从来没得到过我想要的
because I never got anything I wanted.

366
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:15,300
但我的确很想来这个学校
But I do want to go to this school

367
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:17,020
超越我以前所有热忱
more than I've ever wanted anything.

368
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,100
这是我的幻想  也是我的梦想
It's my fantasy and my dream,

369
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:22,340
拜托不要再让我继续说这些恶心的词了
and please stop making me use these horrible, horrible words!

370
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:25,140
求求你  录取我吧
Just let me in, okay?

371
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:27,340
好吧
Okay.

372
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,940
-等等  真的吗  -真的
