373
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:39,800
我只想看看你的热忱是不是跟你的水果塔一样棒
I needed to see if your passion was as good as your pastry

374
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,740
而你已经表现给我看了
and you just showed me it was.

375
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,900
非常高兴你加入我们  大厨
I'm thrilled to have you on board, chef.

376
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:46,860
谢谢  主厨
Thanks, chef.

377
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:51,740
碧碧恐慌症发作  她说要抱她的柠檬
Bebe is having a panic attack and needs to hold her lemon.

378
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:53,100
有人见过她的柠檬吗
Has anyone seen her lemon?

379
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:57,000
卡洛琳  他录取我了  我要上烘焙学校啦
Caroline, he let me in. I'm going to pastry school.

380
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,860
从现在开始  人人都得叫我"大厨"
Everybody has to call me "Chef" now!

381
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:00,400
你成功了  大厨
You did it, chef!

382
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,540
你被宣传册上的烘焙学校录取了
You're going to the pastry school from the brochure!

383
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,260
你是不是该高兴我看了你的黄书啊
Aren't you glad I looked at your porn?

384
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,920
我们是室友  都是单身  很惊喜吧
We're roommates. Both single. Quelle surprise.

385
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:15,080
麦克斯  只要把表填了
So Max, once you fill out these,

386
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,560
你就算正式人学了
you will be officially enrolled.

387
