我可以在办公室帮忙  以换取学费
In exchange for tuition, I could work in the office.

404
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:06,180
碧碧显然需要人来帮她解除压力
Bebe clearly needs someone to help take the pressure off

405
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:07,880
我是沃顿毕业  而且精神稳定
And who better than a mentally stable

406
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:09,360
没有比我更合适的人选了
Wharton graduate like myself?

407
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:10,460
但我什么都愿意干
But I'll do anything.

408
