甚至连洗地板都行
I'll even wash your floors, okay?

409
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:14,460
虽然我觉得肯定有比这更好的活
Although I'm sure there's something better than that.

410
00:19:14,460 --> 00:19:16,300
但如果你需要我洗地板
But if you need me to wash the floors,

411
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:17,440
我就洗地板
